{"text": "The loss of insect life from the food chain would not just be disastrous for wildlife. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It would also have direct consequences for the human food supply. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Most Europeans and North Americans are disgusted by the prospect of eating insects, which is odd, since they consume prawns which are broadly similar, being segmented, and with an external skeleton. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Their ancient ancestors would certainly have eaten insects. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Globally, however, eating insects is the norm, and in some countries insects make up a significant proportion of the diet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Roughly 80 per cent of the worlds population regularly consume insects, with the practice very common in South America, Africa and Asia, and among the native peoples of Oceania. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Approximately 2, 000 different insect species are regularly eaten by people, including caterpillars, beetle grubs, ants, wasps, moth pupae, stink bugs, grasshoppers and crickets. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To give an example, it is estimated that 1, 600 tons of mopane worms are sold for human consumption in South Africa each year, with many more privately collected and consumed.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "l", "o", "s", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "i", "n", "s", "e", "c", "t", " ", "l", "i", "f", "e", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "o", "d", " ", "c", "h", "a", "i", "n", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "j", "u", "s", "t", " ", "b", "e", " ", "d", "i", "s", "a", "s", "t", "r", "o", "u", "s", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "w", "i", "l", "d", "l", "i", "f", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "a", "l", "s", "o", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "d", "i", "r", "e", "c", "t", " ", "c", "o", "n", "s", "e", "q", "u", "e", "n", "